      <span>Tours</span>
      <span class="material-symbols-outlined text-[14px]">chevron_right</span>
      <span class="text-navy font-semibold">Shared Snorkeling</span>
    </nav>
    <div class="mb-2">
      <h1 class="text-4xl text-navy leading-tight">Shared Sailing &amp; Snorkeling Tour in Cabo</h1>
    </div>
    <p class="text-slate-500 text-base leading-relaxed mt-4">
      Join a small group sailing adventure to Cabo's most iconic spots — sail past the Arch, snorkel at Pelican Rock, and enjoy open bar and lunch onboard.
    </p>
    <p class="text-slate-500 text-base leading-relaxed mt-3">
      A relaxed, social way to experience Cabo at an unbeatable price — never more than 14 guests on board.
    </p>

    <!-- Badges row -->
    <div class="flex gap-4 mt-8">
      <div class="bg-light-grey rounded-2xl px-6 py-4 flex flex-col items-center text-center border border-border-light flex-1">
        <span class="material-symbols-outlined text-gold mb-2">schedule</span>
        <p class="text-xs text-slate-400 uppercase font-bold tracking-widest mb-1">Duration</p>
        <p class="text-base font-bold text-navy">3 Hours</p>
      </div>
      <div class="bg-light-grey rounded-2xl px-6 py-4 flex flex-col items-center text-center border border-border-light flex-1">
        <span class="material-symbols-outlined text-gold mb-2">sailing</span>
        <p class="text-xs text-slate-400 uppercase font-bold tracking-widest mb-1">Difficulty</p>
        <p class="text-base font-bold text-navy">Easy</p>
      </div>
      <div class="bg-light-grey rounded-2xl px-6 py-4 flex flex-col items-center text-center border border-border-light flex-1">
        <span class="material-symbols-outlined text-gold mb-2">family_restroom</span>
        <p class="text-xs text-slate-400 uppercase font-bold tracking-widest mb-1">Family</p>
        <p class="text-base font-bold text-navy">Friendly</p>
      </div>
      <div class="bg-light-grey rounded-2xl px-6 py-4 flex flex-col items-center text-center border border-border-light flex-1">
        <span class="material-symbols-outlined text-gold mb-2">event_available</span>
        <p class="text-xs text-slate-400 uppercase font-bold tracking-widest mb-1">Free Cancellation</p>
        <p class="text-base font-bold text-navy">Up to 24h</p>
      </div>
    </div>

    <!-- About this experience -->
    <div class="mt-10">
      <h3 class="text-2xl text-navy mb-4">About this experience</h3>
      <p class="text-slate-500 leading-relaxed text-base">
        Join our popular shared snorkeling tour and discover the magic of Cabo San Lucas alongside fellow adventurers. Visit the famous Arch, snorkel alongside tropical fish at Pelican Rock, and enjoy a refreshing open bar and lunch onboard — all at an unbeatable price. Our experienced bilingual crew makes sure everyone has a safe, fun, and unforgettable time on the water.
      </p>

