          <li class="relative"><span class="absolute -left-[33px] top-0 w-6 h-6 rounded-full bg-navy text-white text-[11px] font-bold flex items-center justify-center">2</span><span class="text-slate-600 text-base">Sail past Land's End — the Arch, the sea lion colony, and rock formations</span></li>
