          <li class="relative"><span class="absolute -left-[33px] top-0 w-6 h-6 rounded-full bg-navy text-white text-[11px] font-bold flex items-center justify-center">4</span><span class="text-slate-600 text-base">Enjoy lunch and unlimited drinks on deck</span></li>
          <li class="relative"><span class="absolute -left-[33px] top-0 w-6 h-6 rounded-full bg-navy text-white text-[11px] font-bold flex items-center justify-center">5</span><span class="text-slate-600 text-base">12:00 PM — Sail back to the marina with new friends and great memories</span></li>
        </ol>
        <p class="mt-5 text-slate-500 italic text-sm">A relaxed, social adventure on the water — and unbeatable value.</p>
