          </div>
        </div>
        <div class="flex items-center gap-4">
          <div class="w-6 h-6 rounded-full bg-navy flex items-center justify-center flex-shrink-0">
            <span class="material-symbols-outlined text-white text-[14px]">sailing</span>
          </div>
          <div>
            <span class="text-slate-600 text-base font-medium">Comfortable sailing yacht</span>
            <p class="text-slate-400 text-sm">Smooth ride with limited guests onboard</p>
